Z||000000||Formula||09-27-2000||10:49 PM||||as many of you know, I have monkeys tailight mod on my car.....black with circles *redone 3 times now lol) and I just got my car painted Viper Red with 3 coats of clear coat, all moldings are body color and the rockers are body color too... now onto the mod... this is more for the ricer type but it makes the car look extremly exotic! I took the red and white lenses out of the "unit" and put red bulbs in.  it makes the lights look silver when they are off (behind the black of course) and they shine bright red when they are lit.  I was followed by a cop already (clear tailights are highly illegal here) and he either didnt notice that they were different or they werent bad enough for a citation because they are brighter red then most other car tailights.........just thought I would share this info||||reg||1
